/-- Boundary package for the first non-reflexive `nf`/`Def` case.

The runtime side is the already-certified root `nf` rewrite, which exposes the
`def-body-of`/`let`/`if` body and is genuinely non-reflexive.  The declaration
side is the real Stage-3 value-bearing witness constant, whose `δ`-step is
already proved in `CICGuestBridge`.  The missing bridge between these two facts
is precisely the shared `def-body-of`/`let`/`if` control-flow seam needed for
full nontrivial `nf` and for `conv_sound`; this theorem does not hide that seam
behind a premise. -/
theorem nf_def_root_and_stage3_delta_boundary :
    Relation.ReflTransGen (Metta.KernelStep kernelNfDefRootRules stdGroundings)
        (nfQuery cicStage3RawArtifactSig (.defn cicStage3PropToType0WitnessName))
