        ruleInferSrtType, ruleInferSrtKind, ruleInferBad, ruleConv, mExpr, mSym,
        mVar, mTypeDecl, mBool]
    · refine ⟨defBodyOfDDefRuleBindings rest defName type body queryName, ?_, ?_⟩
